flowchart TD
  Start[install.sh] --> Preflight[Environment & prerequisite checks]
  Preflight --> Ports[Validate host-port ownership contract]
  Ports --> Secrets[Generate / validate runtime credentials]
  Secrets --> Wazuh[Deploy Wazuh single-node stack]
  Wazuh --> API[Configure Wazuh API on TCP 15500]
  API --> Shuffle[Deploy Shuffle single-node execution plane]
  Shuffle --> Swarm[Initialize / validate Docker Swarm]
  Swarm --> Health[Run cross-service health checks]
  Health --> Ready{Healthy?}
  Ready -->|Yes| Done[SOCLab ready]
  Ready -->|No| Diagnose[Print diagnostics and fail safely]
  Diagnose --> Fix[Correct config / port / service issue]
  Fix --> Health
